  "_howToAddAVenue": [
    "This file is the one list of venues. The site reads it, and the backend reads the published copy at https://picklematch.com.au/venues.json.",
    "To add a Play By Point venue: copy an existing entry, give it the venue's facilityId (id is the same number as text), its PBP slug, name, address, lat/lng, logo and details, then publish.",
    "status: 'active' (fetched and shown) or 'delisted' (kept so old bookings still show a name). fetcher: 'court_blocks' for normal PBP venues, 'sportswell' for SportsWell-style ones. bookingEnabled: can players book courts through PickleMatch.",
    "map: 'bookable' (orange pin) or 'listed' (grey pin). A venue that is only on the map needs just id, name, city, address, lat, lng and map.",
    "rates: fallback hourly court prices, used only when PBP sends none. Optional."
  ],
